    <category term="技术" scheme="https://senxl.github.io/categories/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/"/>
    <category term="stm32" scheme="https://senxl.github.io/tags/stm32/"/>
    <category term="嵌入式" scheme="https://senxl.github.io/tags/%E5%B5%8C%E5%85%A5%E5%BC%8F/"/>
    <category term="流水灯" scheme="https://senxl.github.io/tags/%E6%B5%81%E6%B0%B4%E7%81%AF/"/>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<h2 id="小小寄存器，秃头大秘密"><a href="#小小寄存器，秃头大秘密" class="headerlink" title="小小寄存器，秃头大秘密"></a>小小寄存器，秃头大秘密</h2><p>前提准备：</p><ol><li>软件 Keil5</li><li>正点原子 Mini STM32F103RCT6 开发板</li></ol><span id="more"></span><p>主要程序代码奉上：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&quot;stm32f10x.h&quot;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">void</span> <span class="title function_">delay</span><span class="params">()</span></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> i=<span class="number">2000000</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">while</span>(i--);</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">main</span><span class="params">()</span></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// PA8 的 LED0 初始</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 打开 PA 端口时钟</span></span><br><span class="line">    *(<span class="type">unsigned</span> <span class="type">int</span> *)<span class="number">0x40021018</span> |= (<span class="number">1</span>&lt;&lt;<span class="number">2</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// IO CRL 输出设置 (PA8 属于高寄存器)</span></span><br><span class="line">    *(<span class="type">unsigned</span> <span class="type">int</span> *)<span class="number">0x40010804</span> |= (<span class="number">1</span>&lt;&lt;(<span class="number">4</span>*<span class="number">0</span>));</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// ODR 寄存器控制</span></span><br><span class="line">    *(<span class="type">unsigned</span> <span class="type">int</span> *)<span class="number">0x4001080C</span> |= (<span class="number">1</span>&lt;&lt;<span class="number">8</span>);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// PD2 的 LED1 初始</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 打开 PD 端口时钟</span></span><br><span class="line">    *(<span class="type">unsigned</span> <span class="type">int</span> *)<span class="number">0x40021018</span> |= (<span class="number">1</span>&lt;&lt;<span class="number">5</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// IO CRL 输出设置 (PD2 属于低寄存器)</span></span><br><span class="line">    *(<span class="type">unsigned</span> <span class="type">int</span> *)<span class="number">0x40011400</span> |= (<span class="number">1</span>&lt;&lt;(<span class="number">4</span>*<span class="number">2</span>));</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// ODR 寄存器控制</span></span><br><span class="line">    *(<span class="type">unsigned</span> <span class="type">int</span> *)<span class="number">0x4001140C</span> |= (<span class="number">1</span>&lt;&lt;<span class="number">2</span>);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">while</span>(<span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment">// 利用寄存器实现流水灯效果</span></span><br><span class="line">        *(<span class="type">unsigned</span> <span class="type">int</span> *)<span class="number">0x4001080C</span> &amp;= ~(<span class="number">1</span>&lt;&lt;<span class="number">8</span>);</span><br><span class="line">        *(<span class="type">unsigned</span> <span class="type">int</span> *)<span class="number">0x4001140C</span> |= (<span class="number">1</span>&lt;&lt;<span class="number">2</span>);</span><br><span class="line">        delay();</span><br><span class="line">        *(<span class="type">unsigned</span> <span class="type">int</span> *)<span class="number">0x4001140C</span> &amp;= ~(<span class="number">1</span>&lt;&lt;<span class="number">2</span>);</span><br><span class="line">        *(<span class="type">unsigned</span> <span class="type">int</span> *)<span class="number">0x4001080C</span> |= (<span class="number">1</span>&lt;&lt;<span class="number">8</span>);</span><br><span class="line">        delay();</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>以上代码实现了<strong>两个 LED 灯依次闪烁</strong>的效果。</p><h2 id="工程图"><a href="#工程图" class="headerlink" title="工程图"></a>工程图</h2><ul><li><code>startup_stm32f10x_hd.s</code> 是启动文件，可在正点官方资料包复制过来</li><li><code>stm32f10x.h</code> 文件为空，自己添加即可</li></ul><p><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/senxl/hexo-cdn/img/posts/stm32/QQ%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE20201006203440.jpg" alt="工程示意图1"></p><p><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/senxl/hexo-cdn/img/posts/stm32/QQ%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE20201006203543.jpg" alt="工程示意图2"></p><p><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/senxl/hexo-cdn/img/posts/stm32/QQ%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE20201006203600.jpg" alt="工程示意图3"></p>]]>
    </content>
